# No Git Commits

The user commits and pushes by themselves.

Never run:
- `git commit` (including `--amend`)
- `git push`
- `git merge`, `git rebase`, `git cherry-pick`, `git revert`, `git reset`, `git tag`
- Any other command that creates commits or rewrites history.

Allowed: read-only git commands such as `git status`, `git diff`, `git log`, `git show`, `git blame`.

When work is ready, leave changes uncommitted in the working tree and tell the user.
